---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import JoinCallout from '../components/JoinCallout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config.js';
---
<Base
  title="Your First Karate Class in Golden, BC"
  description="New to karate? What to wear, when to arrive and what happens at your first Shotokan karate class in Golden, BC."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Your first class</h1>
      <p>Everything you need to know before you step on the floor. No experience needed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>1. Register online</h2>
      <p>Fill in the <a href="/register">registration form</a>. We'll email to confirm and answer any questions before you come.</p>
      <h2>2. What to wear</h2>
      <p>Comfortable athletic clothes like a T-shirt and track pants. We train barefoot. Remove jewellery and tie back long hair. You can buy a karate uniform (gi) later once you know you love it.</p>
      <h2>3. When to arrive</h2>
      <p>Arrive 10 to 15 minutes before 6:00 pm on Monday or Wednesday so we can meet you, show you where to change, and introduce you to the class.</p>
      <h2>4. What happens in class</h2>
      <p>You'll learn how to bow in, basic stances, punches and blocks. Beginners work at their own pace, and an instructor or senior student will guide you through each drill.</p>
      <h2>5. Bring</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>A water bottle</li>
        <li>Any medical information we should know about (also asked on the form)</li>
        <li>Parents: you're welcome to stay and watch</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Dojo etiquette in one minute</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Bow when you enter and leave the training floor</li>
        <li>Address instructors as <em>Sensei</em></li>
        <li>Keep nails short and the floor clear of shoes</li>
        <li>Respect your partners: control comes before power</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Questions? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a> or call <a href={`tel:${SITE.phone.replace(/[^\d+]/g, '')}`}>{SITE.phone}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <JoinCallout />
</Base>
